The latest versions of the reference grammar including a much-reduced
negation paper and an expanded logic paper (some material was transferred from
the latter to the former) are now available by ftp from
ftp://ftp.access.digex.net/pub/access/lojbab; the *.txt files
are the grammar.  Each one is now marked on the first line with the
chapter number from 1 to 19; Chapter 20 will be the YACC and BNF
grammars and is not yet delivered.

Comments and criticisms are URGENTLY solicited from the entire Lojban
community, including particularly the newbies and lurkers among us.

